    {
      "id": "claim_3028048e9ad644b1855a74bca7ee4ff2",
      "statement": "The Path 1 harness is intentionally distinct from AgentCore's native `ThirdParty.DeepEval.*` evaluators: the node README says those AWS-native evaluators run against deployed-runtime sessions, while this harness uses the pip `deepeval` package and custom metrics.",
